<title>CANADA: Power Corp of Canada Q3 profit rises.</title>
<headline>Power Corp of Canada Q3 profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>MONTREAL 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			 1995</p>
<p> Shr			 C$0.49		   C$0.41</p>
<p> Net			 53,955		   52,625</p>
<p> Revs		   1,716,830		1,804,837</p>
<p>	    9 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			 C$1.89		   C$1.25</p>
<p> Net			233,227		  161,620</p>
<p> Revs		   5,027,413		5,454,569</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>Note: Other income of a non-recurring nature, net of minority interest and income taxes, consists of the company's net gain on the sale of its interest in Southam Inc and share of net gains on the sale of long-term holdings by companies in the Pargessa group. Other income in the latest nine-month period was C$56.1 million, or C$0.45 a share, compared with C$1.8 million, or C$0.02 a share in the 1995 period.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Montreal bureau (514) 985-2434</p>
